Example:
    []int: items
    int: start
    int: end
    []int: replacement
    return: @
    run:
        throws: copy(replaceRange\throws) copy(sum\throws)
        []int: result [copy(items)]
        replaceRange(result; start; end; replacement)
        return: (result; \(sum (result != items)); \(sum (result - items)))
